          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "This list entry was subject to a Minor Amendment on 1 May 2026 to update the Name and Address and reformat the text to current standards TL 00 SE 3/6 ABBOTS LANGLEY Pimlico BEDMOND ROAD (East side) Rose Acre House (Formerly listed as Bourzuei) GV II House. Early C18 with C16 cross wing. Altered and extended C19 and C20. Part timber framed.  Cased and extended in whitewashed brick,  some weatherboarding. Tiled roof. Earlier cross wing at right angles to main range. Two storeys. Early C18 front to yard is three bays with a central entrance in a later gabled porch, flanking C20 rectangular bays, first floor two light flush frame timber casements. Dentilled brick eaves. To right a one bay C19 addition with a lower ridge. To rear left is bay cross wing with a separate taller ridge. Brick cased. Single and two light casements. Weatherboarded gable to front with originally external stack with large base, three shafts, outer diagonally set. Rear gable end has an entrance with a cambered head, two light casements, weatherboarded gable. Inside angle of L is a C19 block with lower ridge parallel to front range,  three light casements, gable end stack. Interior not inspected. Formerly known as Rose Acre Farm House. Listing NGR: TL0949504804"
    }
  ],
